استورد compiler.diagnostics.identity;
استورد compiler.diagnostics.reason;
استورد compiler.ispeak.keys.clauses;

// English context clauses. Each clause is the opening of one complete sentence;
// the shared composer appends the fact and the full stop.

// Source-backed primary facts use identity-specific wording. The fallback
// remains a complete localized sentence for auxiliary and new message keys.
